      "notes": "Blocks 1 and 4 are one physical building, as the campus owner annotated the map (2026-10-22). Its position is the centre of the mapped footprint OpenStreetMap way/897374294; the identity is the owner's annotation, not OpenStreetMap metadata. The Seminar Hall is reported as part of Block 4 and so is placed here too. The older official geotags for Blocks 1 and 4 (a shared camera position printed to three or four decimals) are no longer used for them.",
